# Production build env vars.
#
# Checked in deliberately — both values are public by design:
#   - VITE_SUPABASE_URL is a public REST endpoint.
#   - VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY is a "publishable" key (sb_publishable_*) —
#     intended to ship in client bundles. Write protection is enforced by
#     Row-Level Security policies in supabase/migrations/0001_init.sql.
#
# Why not use Cloudflare's Build environment variables instead?
# We tried — they're set correctly in the Cloudflare dashboard (Build
# section, Variable type, correct values), but as of 2026-06 they don't
# get injected into `npm run build` for Workers + Static Assets projects.
# This file is the deterministic fallback.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://sssseazkhiswjhtmbluh.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=sb_publishable_XyhMnX5iThUucQ2z-jrOhQ_zF2uEUfw
